{"id": "arena-hero-01", "task": "arena", "prompt": "Landing page hero for a developer tool.", "candidates": ["before/after of the node under test"], "judge": "Which hero would a designer say was made for this product rather than any product? Consider the unslop-pass criteria; pick one."}
