{"id": "repair-launch-seam-01", "task": "repair", "issue": "In our HyperFrames launch film the scene change dims halfway like a flash, and the held pricing card never stops breathing.", "input": "tl.to('#sceneA', { opacity: 0, duration: 0.6 }, 5)\n  .to('#sceneB', { opacity: 1, duration: 0.6 }, 5);\ngsap.to('.price-card', { scale: 1.02, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, duration: 1.5, ease: 'sine.inOut' });", "must_match": ["\\.set\\([^)]*\\b((autoAlpha|opacity): ?0(?![.0-9])|visibility: ?['\"]hidden|display: ?['\"]none)"], "must_not_match": ["repeat: ?-1", "yoyo: ?true", "#sceneA['\"]\\s*,\\s*(?:\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{(?=[^}]*\\b(?:opacity|autoAlpha): ?0(?![.0-9]))(?=[^}]*\\bduration: ?(?:0?\\.0*[1-9]|[1-9]))[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*([\\d.]+)\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]*\\.(?:to|fromTo)\\(\\s*['\"]#sceneB['\"]\\s*,\\s*(?:\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{(?=[^}]*\\b(?:opacity|autoAlpha): ?1(?![.0-9]))(?![^}]*\\bduration: ?(?:0+\\.?0*|\\.0+)(?![.0-9]))[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*(?:\\1(?:\\.0+)?|['\"]<['\"])\\s*\\)"], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "gen-launch-zoom-01", "task": "generation", "prompt": "Write the GSAP for a zoom-through seam between two headline scenes (#a exits, #b enters) at t = 2.0 s in a HyperFrames composition.", "must_match": ["#a['\"]\\s*,\\s*(\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{[^}]*power3\\.in(?![A-Za-z])", "#b['\"]\\s*,\\s*(\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{[^}]*expo\\.out", "#a['\"]\\s*,\\s*(\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{[^}]*scale: ?1\\.(20?|18)(?![0-9])", "#b['\"]\\s*,\\s*\\{[^}]*scale: ?0\\.7[58](?![0-9])"], "must_not_match": ["scale: ?0\\.92", "repeat: ?-1"], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "repair-launch-zseam-01", "task": "repair", "issue": "The seam between scene 1 and scene 2 of our launch film reads as a stutter: scene 1 pulls back and scene 2 grows in.", "input": "tl.to('#s1', { scale: 0.8, filter: 'blur(10px)', duration: 0.2, ease: 'power3.in' }, 5.8);\ntl.set('#s1', { autoAlpha: 0 }, 6.0);\ntl.fromTo('#s2', { scale: 0.75, autoAlpha: 1 }, { scale: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: 'expo.out' }, 6.0);", "must_match": ["#s1['\"]\\s*,\\s*(\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{[^}]*scale: ?1\\.(1[5-9]|2\\d?)(?![0-9])[\\s\\S]*#s2['\"]\\s*,\\s*\\{[^}]*scale: ?0\\.[78]\\d?(?![0-9])|#s1['\"]\\s*,\\s*(\\{[^}]*\\}\\s*,\\s*)?\\{[^}]*scale: ?0\\.[78]\\d?(?![0-9])[\\s\\S]*#s2['\"]\\s*,\\s*\\{[^}]*scale: ?1\\.(1[5-9]|2\\d?)(?![0-9])"], "must_not_match": [], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "edit-launch-typing-01", "task": "edit", "instruction": "Viewers must read this prompt in our launch film. Retime the typing.", "input": "tl.to('#prompt', { text: 'Chart weekly sign-ups by region since the launch', duration: 0.9, ease: 'none' }, 3);", "must_match": ["\\btext: ?(?:\\{[^}]*\\}|[^{}])*?\\bduration: ?(2\\.[4-9]\\d*|3(\\.\\d+)?|4(\\.0+)?)(?![0-9.])|\\bduration: ?(2\\.[4-9]\\d*|3(\\.\\d+)?|4(\\.0+)?)(?![0-9.])[^{}]*?\\btext:|\\b(stagger|each): ?0?\\.0(?:[5-7]\\d*|80*)(?![0-9])|(?<![\\d.])0?\\.0(?:[5-7]\\d*|80*)(?![0-9])\\s*\\*|\\*\\s*0?\\.0(?:[5-7]\\d*|80*)(?![0-9])|=\\s*0?\\.0(?:[5-7]\\d*|80*)(?![0-9])|\\b(length|i|n|k|idx|index|1|48)\\s*\\/\\s*(1[2-9]|20)(?![0-9.])|\\b(cps|CPS|charsPerSec\\w*|chars_per_sec\\w*)\\s*[=:]\\s*(1[2-9]|20)(?![0-9.])"], "must_not_match": ["\\btext: ?(?:\\{[^}]*\\}|[^{}])*?\\bduration: ?0?\\.90*(?![0-9])|\\bduration: ?0?\\.90*(?![0-9])[^{}]*?\\btext:"], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "gen-launch-sfx-01", "task": "generation", "prompt": "In a HyperFrames composition the cursor press bottoms out (scale 0.90, the contact frame) at 3.40 s. Add assets/sfx-click.mp3, whose measured onset is 158 ms after the file start, so the click lands on the contact.", "must_match": ["data-start=['\"]?3\\.24|data-media-start=['\"]?0?\\.1[56]", "<audio[^>]*\\bid="], "must_not_match": ["data-start=['\"]?3\\.24[^>]*data-media-start=['\"]?0?\\.1[56]|data-media-start=['\"]?0?\\.1[56][^>]*data-start=['\"]?3\\.24"], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "gen-launch-drop-01", "task": "generation", "prompt": "Add the music to a 50 s HyperFrames launch film. The clip starts at film time 0 (data-start=\"0\"). The licensed track runs 2:40; its drop is 21.6 s into the file and the product name lands at 9.2 s in the film. Write the <audio> element.", "must_match": ["data-media-start=['\"]?12\\.40*['\"]?(?=[\\s>/])", "<audio[^>]*\\bid="], "must_not_match": ["data-media-start=['\"]?0(\\.0+)?['\"]?(?=[\\s>/])"], "checklist_rows": []}
{"id": "gen-type-01", "task": "generation", "clusters": ["typography"], "prompt": "Set the body and heading typography for a long-form article page in CSS: font sizes, line height, measure, heading wrapping and numerals in a data table.", "must_match": ["max-width: ?\\d{2}ch|max-inline-size: ?\\d{2}ch", "text-wrap: ?(balance|pretty)", "tabular-nums"], "must_not_match": ["font-size: ?1[0-3]px", "text-align: ?justify"], "checklist_rows": []}
