{"id": "repair-ai-hero-01", "task": "repair", "clusters": ["anti-patterns", "surface", "components"], "issue": "This landing hero looks AI-generated. Fix the markup and CSS so it reads like a real product.", "input": "<section class=\"hero\"><h1 class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Unlock the Power of Seamless Collaboration 🚀</h1><p>Supercharge your workflow with our cutting-edge, AI-powered platform.</p><button class=\"rounded-full shadow-2xl\">Get Started Now →</button></section>", "must_match": ["<h1"], "must_not_match": ["Unlock the [Pp]ower", "from-purple-500", "🚀", "[Ss]upercharge", "cutting-edge"], "checklist_rows": []}
